{
  "id": "bamboohr",
  "name": "BambooHR",
  "match": [
    "bamboohr.com"
  ],
  "verifiedAgainstLiveForm": "2026-09-18",
  "notes": [
    "The form is not in the page until 'Apply for This Job' is clicked; applyr's",
    "MutationObserver picks it up when it appears.",
    "Address parts are namespaced with a .value suffix (streetAddress.value, city.value,",
    "state.value, zip.value, countryId.value). Screening questions are",
    "customQuestionAnswers.short_<id> / .long_<id> and carry a per-posting id, so generic",
    "mode answers them from their labels.",
    "submit is deliberately empty: the Submit and Cancel buttons are BOTH type=submit,",
    "so a selector would log a false submission when the user cancels. The content",
    "script's button-text heuristic recognises 'Submit Application' and ignores Cancel.",
    "This form also carries a honeypot (nickname_hpcsaf, labelled 'Please leave this",
    "field blank') which is fully visible and would otherwise match preferred_name - see",
    "isIgnored() in content/detector.js."
  ],
  "detect": {
    "any": [
      "#job-application-form",
      "input[name='streetAddress.value']",
      "input[name='linkedinUrl'][id='linkedinUrl']"
    ]
  },
  "meta": {
    "company": [
      "meta[property='og:site_name']",
      "[class*='company-name']"
    ],
    "role": [
      "h1",
      "meta[property='og:title']"
    ]
  },
  "submit": [],
  "confirm": [
    "[class*='application-confirmation']",
    "[class*='thank-you']"
  ],
  "widgets": {
    "combobox": {
      "trigger": "[role='combobox'], button[class*='fab-select'], [class*='fabric-select']",
      "option": "[role='option'], [class*='fab-menu-option']"
    }
  },
  "fields": [
    {
      "id": "first_name",
      "selector": ["#job-application-form input[name='firstName']", "#firstName"]
    },
    {
      "id": "last_name",
      "selector": ["#job-application-form input[name='lastName']", "#lastName"]
    },
    {
      "id": "email",
      "selector": ["#job-application-form input[name='email']", "#email"]
    },
    {
      "id": "phone",
      "selector": ["#job-application-form input[name='phone']", "#phone"]
    },
    {
      "id": "address_line1",
      "selector": ["input[name='streetAddress.value']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "city",
      "selector": ["input[name='city.value']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "state",
      "selector": ["input[name='state.value']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "postal_code",
      "selector": ["input[name='zip.value']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "country",
      "selector": ["select[name='countryId.value']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "resume_file",
      "selector": ["#job-application-form input[type='file']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "desired_salary",
      "selector": ["#job-application-form input[name='desiredPay']", "#desiredPay"]
    },
    {
      "id": "portfolio_url",
      "selector": ["#job-application-form input[name='websiteUrl']", "#websiteUrl"]
    },
    {
      "id": "linkedin_url",
      "selector": ["#job-application-form input[name='linkedinUrl']", "#linkedinUrl"]
    },
    {
      "id": "degree",
      "selector": ["select[name='educationLevelId']", "#educationLevelId"]
    }
  ]
}
